      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: well it's just a thought not a real serious thing to worry so much about It would just be more of a convenience of it being there on the main page instead of in big menu. Most of the time I may close my app due to audio glitches or just in general going on a different game and then coming back which it's mostly that. But it would be nice having a feature like that just minus the whole have two different confirms just to close an app I would just say one confirm would be okay",
