  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-10-07T02:49:14.075Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So I've been playing VR chat for a couple of months, and have noticed that the power down button or exit application is in the settings page. I would wish it would be moved to the main page when you open up the menu and have it in the bottom in the bottom right next to the safe mode button. But as a recommendation have it where it warns you, that you're about to close your game down and ask you at least two times the first time and then the second time to make sure you're 100% sure, but if you don't like seeing the second message you can have it where I will never show it again when it mentions it to you.\n\n(Example: if you keep closing your app down and have to press yes two times on both alerts and then on your second time you're closing down the app it shows the option that you do not want to see this message again on your second alert screen when you're closing down the app/game)\n\nI hope that some of it makes sense as I would think it would be a minor change but also pretty good and more convenient, especially for PC users and quest users and soon to be Android users.",
